{"SystemName":"OrderCancelled.StoreOwnerNotification","Title":"{{Store.Name}} - M\u00FC\u015Fteri sipari\u015F iptali bilgilendirmesi","Content":"\u003Cdiv style=\u0022font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; color: #333;\u0022\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.URL}}\u0022 style=\u0022font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ch2 style=\u0022color: #e74c3c; margin-top: 0;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015F \u0130ptal Bilgilendirmesi\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022margin-bottom: 15px;\u0022\u003EBir m\u00FC\u015Fteri sipari\u015Fini iptal etti. A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da iptal edilen sipari\u015Fin \u00F6zeti bulunmaktad\u0131r.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Ctable style=\u0022width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; width: 40%;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015F Numaras\u0131:\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 8px 0;\u0022\u003E{{Order.OrderNumber}}\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015F Detaylar\u0131:\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 8px 0;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca target=\u0022_blank\u0022 href=\u0022{{Order.OrderURLForCustomer}}\u0022 style=\u0022color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015F detaylar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FCle\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015F Tarihi:\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022padding: 8px 0;\u0022\u003E{{Order.CreatedOn}}\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022margin-bottom: 20